Again the list comes through:

I would like to thank (in no order):
Sheila Hollenbaugh <shollen@valhalla.cs.wright.edu>
 arthur@midir.ucd.ie
Harald Lundberg <hl@tekla.fi>
and anyone else who may respond

It seems that the problem relates to there only being a CR at the end of
each line, 
and not a CR/LF.
Arthur suggested FTP'ing (using BINARY mode) a DOS text file to the UNIX
box, and trying to print that. Which, of course, worked like a charm. 
The solution for UNIX files is to create a print filter to put a CR at the
end of each line.

Thanks again for your time, managers

