From tru64-unix-managers  Mon May 20 21:42:58 1996
From: Phil VanHelden <vanhelde () odo ! msoe ! edu>
Date: Mon, 20 May 1996 21:42:58 +0000
To: tru64-unix-managers
Subject: SUMMARY:  Automounter problems
X-MARC-Message: https://marc.info/?l=tru64-unix-managers&m=96076332421432

Thanks to "Gernot M. Fuchs" <gfuchs@golay.med.unc.edu>
for the fast response.

The solution was as follows:

I changed the automounter map to the following:
----
/nfs/local      odo:/usr/local
/nfs/contribw   odo:/usr/contrib
/home2          odo:/home2
/home3          odo:/home3
----

And the automount args to the following:
----
AUTOMOUNT_ARGS="-v -M /tmp_mnt /- /etc/automount.map -rw"
----

And all was good with the world!

