Thanks to a number of people who responded to my questions about dual
host and dual redundant HSZ40's.  They pointed me to a tri-link
connector (a "Y" SCSI connector).

They also suggested looking at the "DECsafe ASE Hardware configuration
guide" which is on the 3.2D distribution media.

